{"sha": "5b6ec49081e6ac6cbf33d569dca4aa24fb1d6d69f41089c3d87c6e5450ccfd25", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g12:satellites-kepler} 章 --- 卫星与行星运动}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:satellites-kepler:1}", "在地面上：$F = GMm/R^2 = \\num{3.98e17}/\\num{4.06e13} \\approx", "\\qty{9.8e3}{N}$。当 $r = \\qty{6.77e6}{m}$ 时：", "$F \\approx \\qty{8.7e3}{N}$ --- 仍为地面值的 $89\\%$。", "航天员之所以漂浮，是因为他们与空间站一起\\emph{下落}，", "而不是因为重力消失了。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:satellites-kepler:2}", "$v = \\sqrt{GM/R} = \\sqrt{\\num{3.98e14}/\\num{6.37e6}} \\approx", "\\qty{7.9e3}{m/s}$; $T = 2\\pi R/v \\approx \\qty{5.1e3}{s} \\approx", "\\qty{84}{min}$。这恰好是炮弹的 \\qty{7.9}{km/s}：贴地", "轨道\\emph{正是}牛顿的那发炮弹。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:satellites-kepler:3}", "$v \\propto 1/\\sqrt{r}$：除以 $\\sqrt 2 \\approx 1.41$。", "$T \\propto r^{3/2}$：乘以 $2^{3/2} \\approx 2.8$。二者", "均不含 $m$：否。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:satellites-kepler:4}", "$v = \\sqrt{\\num{3.98e14}/\\num{6.77e6}} \\approx \\qty{7.67e3}{m/s}$;", "$T = 2\\pi r/v \\approx \\qty{5.55e3}{s} \\approx \\qty{92}{min}$;", "每天绕行 $\\num{86400}/5546 \\approx 15.6$ 圈。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:satellites-kepler:5}", "轨道为以太阳为焦点的椭圆；相等时间内扫过相等面积；", "$T^2/a^3$ 对所有行星都相同。速率在近日点最大，由", "开普勒第二定律（短弧段须扫得快）。否：卫星的", "质量相互抵消 --- 只有中心天体的质量起作用。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:satellites-kepler:6}", "$T = \\qty{2.36e6}{s}$: $M = 4\\pi^2 r^3/(GT^2) =", "\\num{2.24e27}/371 \\approx \\qty{6.0e24}{kg}$ --- 与", "\\qty{5.97e24}{kg} 相差在 $1\\%$ 以内。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:satellites-kepler:7}", "重力指向地心，而圆周运动中合力指向", "圆心：两个中心必须重合。位于巴黎纬线上方的", "圆，其圆心在地轴上而非地心，这是不可能的。", "悬停只有在纬线是以地心为圆心的大圆时才可行，", "即在\\emph{赤道}上空。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:satellites-kepler:8}", "$T = \\qty{2.754e4}{s}$: $M = 4\\pi^2 r^3/(GT^2) =", "\\num{3.26e22}/\\num{5.06e-2} \\approx \\qty{6.4e23}{kg}$ --- 数据卡上的", "火星。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:satellites-kepler:9}", "地球：$T^2/a^3 = \\num{9.96e14}/\\num{3.35e33} =", "\\qty{2.98e-19}{s^2/m^3}$。火星：$T = \\qty{5.94e7}{s}$，", "$\\num{3.52e15}/\\num{1.18e34} = \\qty{2.98e-19}{s^2/m^3}$ --- 相等，符合", "第三定律的要求。则 $M = 4\\pi^2/(G \\times \\num{2.98e-19})", "\\approx \\qty{1.99e30}{kg}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:satellites-kepler:10}", "$v = 2\\pi r/T = \\qty{1.02e3}{m/s}$; $a = v^2/r =", "\\qty{2.72e-3}{m/s^2}$; $g/60^2 = 9.81/3600 = \\qty{2.73e-3}{m/s^2}$.", "月球位于 $60$ 个地球半径之外，其下落", "加速度比苹果小 $60^2$ 倍：正是平方反比 --- 同一定律", "适用于两者。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:satellites-kepler:11}", "谷神星：$T = 2.77^{3/2} = \\sqrt{21.3} \\approx \\qty{4.6}{yr}$。哈雷彗星：", "$T = 17.8^{3/2} \\approx \\qty{75}{yr}$，故下一次近日点约在", "$1986 + 75 \\approx 2061$ 年。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:satellites-kepler:12}", "在 \\qty{400}{km} 处：$v \\approx \\qty{7.67e3}{m/s}$；在 \\qty{350}{km}", "（$r = \\qty{6.72e6}{m}$）：$v \\approx \\qty{7.70e3}{m/s}$。摩擦力", "确实消耗机械能 --- 轨道缩小；但在下降途中", "重力做的功足以弥补阻力造成的速率损失：", "$E_m$ 减小，而 $E_k$ 增大。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:satellites-kepler:13}", "$T = \\qty{3.024e5}{s}$: $M = 4\\pi^2 r^3/(GT^2) =", "\\num{1.65e31}/6.10 \\approx \\qty{2.7e30}{kg} \\approx 1.4$ 个太阳质量。", "\\emph{行星}的质量无法求出：它在轨道", "方程中已被消去。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:satellites-kepler:14}", "$T = \\qty{8.862e4}{s}$, $GM = \\qty{4.28e13}{m^3/s^2}$:", "$r^3 = GMT^2/(4\\pi^2) = \\num{8.52e21}$，故 $r \\approx", "\\qty{2.04e7}{m}$，且 $h = r - R \\approx \\qty{1.7e7}{m} \\approx", "\\qty{17000}{km}$，即高出火星地面。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:satellites-kepler:15}", "$v_a = r_p v_p / r_a = \\num{8.77e10} \\times \\num{5.45e4} /", "\\num{5.25e12} \\approx \\qty{9.1e2}{m/s}$。由于 $r_a/r_p \\approx 60$，", "彗星的距离远 $60$ 倍，速率慢 $60$ 倍：它在", "黑暗中徘徊数十年，却在数周内疾驰掠过太阳。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g12:satellites-kepler:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $T = \\qty{86164}{s}$：地面随地球", "\\emph{相对于恒星}每恒星日转一周；\\qty{24}{h}", "的一天多出的那一度，正是地球绕太阳每日前进的角度。", ""]}